httplus

Cross platform http/https C++ object web server


Rules

All html/css/etc files must be contained under ${root}/pub.
	e.g. /var/www/pub/index.html
If the resource is a file, that is found under pub, it is served.
Otherwise it is used as a key to check for generators.
Requests resolving outside of pub, e.g. via "../" or symlinks, are not served.

Generators are registered per root directory, see httplus::Sites.
A root with no generators serves files only.

Each request renders a fresh instance of the generator from Page::clone(),
derive from httplus::PageT<YourPage> to get clone() for free.

File serving rules:
    No file type = text/html
    File type is in config text field = text/plain
    Known file type = its MIME type, e.g. png = image/png
    else = application/octet-stream as an attachment

404 errors are handled by a generator with the key "404" if present, with status 404.
Exceptions from generators respond 500 and are written to ${root}/log/error.log.
Requests are written to ${root}/log/access.log.

## Configure

httplus.yaml:

system:
  threads: 2                    # default 1, per server, overridable per entry
  ssl_cyphers: <CYPHER LIST>    # default https cypher list

http:
  - root: /var/www/global       # no default, mandatory
    host: localhost             # no default
    port: 8888                  # default 80
    home: index                 # optional default page
    text: md log                # optional, file types served as text/plain
    header:                     # optional, added to responses lacking them
      Cache-Control: no-cache
  - root: /var/www/global       # entry without host serves any host on this port
    port: 8888                  # default 80
    home: index                 # optional default page

https:                          # one entry per port
  - root: /var/www/global       # no default, mandatory
    host: localhost             # no default, mandatory
    port: 443                   # default 443
    home: index                 # optional default page
    crt:  /path/to/site.crt     # no default, mandatory
    key:  /path/to/site.key     # no default, mandatory
    chain: /path/to/chain.pem   # no default, optional
    ssl_cyphers: <CYPHER LIST>  # no default, optional

Relative paths are resolved against the directory containing httplus.yaml.

## Generation

See ./usr/html.hpp and ./test.cpp


Switches

Key             HTTPLUS_ACCEPT_GZIP
Type            bool
Default         0
Description     Enables gzip compression of response body when request header "Accept-Encoding" contains "gzip", requires zlib
                e.g. mkn build -a -DHTTPLUS_ACCEPT_GZIP -l -lz
